																		Thanks, and Other Matters
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2039383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609923598" alt="MrWrong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2039383)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;" >MrWrong</a></span> <span class="odate time_1456536400 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">27 Feb 2016 01:26</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2464045">
									

<p>Allow me to express my thanks to the people who reviewed it: Mistbourne, LordStonefish, Tuomey, Moohab etc.</p>
<p>And to address other matters in the article:</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The 'Toʊ' in 'Robinson Toʊ Liz' is a rough phonetic estimation of the Japanese particle と (roughly meaning 'and'). Earlier drafts have it as 'and', but I decided I want to foreshadow it.</p>
<p>And yes, it is a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robinson_list">Robinson list</a>.</p>
<p>The last part (with the stamps) is a reference to the hyper-inflated <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_government-issued_dollar_in_Malaya_and_Borneo">banana money</a> that Imperial Japan issued to Occupied Malaya in WWII (the regime is named Malai Baru). I will note that this article is set in the 70s, where the Japanese economic miracle was still a thing and Japanese money matters.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

