<p>Removed SCP-2752-A and replace it with &quot;subjects&quot; (since they are otherwise normal people that are affected by a mild anomaly, and I use a similar system for SCP-2248). Hopefully the anomaly's object class feels more justified (since the anomaly would be solely mysterious postage letters that pop up randomly in New Zealand).</p>
<p>EDIT: And in line with my re-evaluation, I'm afraid I have to downgrade this to Euclid. It's not as dangerous as Keter&#8230;</p>

